Update a code tool. This PATCH replaces the whole tool config, so supply either `body` (the full replacement config) or all of name/description/source_code -- omitting `body` drops any parameters, execution_context, dynamic_variables, or response_mocks the tool previously had. Requires an Enterprise workspace plan. Docs: https://elevenlabs.io/docs/eleven-agents/customization/tools/code-tools

```ts
